OL,3,CProgramme listings for THU 4 JUN
OL,4,G1900FClassical Mixtape
OL,5,     GHalf an hour of back-to-back
OL,6,     Gclassical music, including works
OL,7,     Gby Bach, Mozart and Amy Beach.
OL,8,G1930FRadio 3 in Concert
OL,9,     GAs part of Wigmore Hall's 125th
OL,10,     GAnniversary Festival, Canadian
OL,11,     Gpianist Angela Hewitt plays
OL,12,     GMozart, Beethoven, Schubert,
OL,13,     GHaydn and Bach.
OL,14,G2145FThe Essay: The Other
OL,15,     FShostakoviches
OL,16,     GChris Addison explores the ill-
OL,17,     Gfated life of the hard-drinking,
OL,18,     Gcigar-smoking wildman of Soviet
OL,19,     Gmusic Alexander Mosolov - whose
OL,20,     Gcareer was interrupted by a spell
OL,21,     Gin the gulag.
